vel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Skylon Spaces moved from ₹ 21,600/sqft to ₹ 22,800/sqft, reflecting a 5.56% rise.\n\nA total of 163 out of 170 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 91% of 2 BHK(73 out of 80 units), 100% of 2.5 B WING 7 AND 14(2 units), 1 BHK(84 units), 2.5 C WING 21(1 units), 2.5 C WING 7 AND 14(2 units), 2.5 B WING 21(1 units).","score":0.55420566,"raw_content":null,"id":"e31ef4-04"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/sai-krupa-skylon-spaces-resale-in-hemu-colony-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-539945-npffid","title":"Sai Krupa Skylon Spaces Resale in Hemu Colony Mumbai","content":"The flat is over 443 sq.Ft. Carpet area and comes with 1 bedroom(s), 1 bathroom . The residential building has 22 floors in total … modern amenities such as","score":0.45682228,"raw_content":null,"id":"5d6ce5-05"},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/hariko-properties/hariko-skylon-spaces-8930","title":"Hariko Skylon Spaces, Kandivali West, Mumbai | 2 BHK Premium Apartments | Houssed","content":"Carpet Area\n\n443 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.45 Cr\n\n2 BHK Flat in Hariko Skylon Spaces in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 626161\n\nCarpet Area\n\n683 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.24 Cr\n\nFloor Plan of Hariko Skylon Spaces in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80938\nMaster Plan of Hariko Skylon Spaces in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80939\n\n## Key Features of Hariko Skylon Spaces Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities Hariko Skylon Spaces Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n### Convenience\n\n### Safety\n\n### Sports\n\n### Leisure\n\n### Environment\n\n### Home Specifications\n\n## Google Map Location of Hariko Skylon Spaces Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai [...] Houssed\nwhatsapp\nProject Image of Hariko Skylon Spaces in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80934\nProject Image of Hariko Skylon Spaces in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80933\nAmenities of Hariko Skylon Spaces in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80935\nAmenities of Hariko Sk